Goal of the request
===================
Enhance the chat system by introducing privacy, moderation, and message traceability features:
- User Anonymity: hide identifiable personal information
- Message Deletion: Possibility to delete sent messages
- Message Timestamps: Record the arrival time of messages

Technical proposition
=====================
Anonymity:
- Add a boolean flag `is_anonymous`
- If the flag is set: mask the sender's name

Message Deletion:
- `is_deleted` flag on the message
- don't keep it on the server ?

Message Arrival Time:
- Add a `received_at` timestamp field, ISO format

Approximate frequency of use
============================
Timestamps: Continuous: on every single message event
Anonymity: Potentially always if needed, on every message
Message Deletion: Potentially always if needed, on every message

Potential problem
=================
Anonymity: Moderation
Timestamps must be done server-side to prevent timezones problem
